title: The Independents at Leipzig
subtitle: The USPD moves to the left.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1919 and month = 12 and crisis = 0
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.repression -= 5;
RG.news('Independents vote at Leipzig to leave the Second International', 3);
!}

= The Independents at Leipzig

The Independent Social Democrats have held their congress in Leipzig. Their party has three-quarters of a million members, many times our own, and its left wing won. The congress adopted the dictatorship of the proletariat on the basis of the councils, left the Second International and resolved to talk to Moscow.

Hilferding and Kautsky's friends still sit in the leadership. Däumig, Stoecker and Koenen of Halle talk of joining the Communist International. [? if kapd_split = 1 : Our own party is half the size it was in October. ?] Radek, about to be sent home from Moabit, writes that the future of German communism is in the USPD's left wing.

- @letter: Propose joint action to the whole USPD.
- @left_wing: Court Däumig, Stoecker and Koenen.
- @denounce: Denounce the Independent leaders as centrists.

@letter
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Their members will turn up. Their leaders will reply politely.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids any deal with the social democrats.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_united_front == 1) { Q.unity -= 10; Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10; }
Q.leipzig_line = 1;
Q.uspd_relation += 12;
Q.worker_support += 3;
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
!}

@left_wing
subtitle: It will take a year. When the USPD splits, more of it will come to us.
on-arrival: {!
Q.leipzig_line = 2;
Q.uspd_score += 2;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 2;
RG.ecci('radek', 6);
!}

Our people seek out Koenen in Halle and Stoecker in Berlin. The talk is of a single Communist party, with the Independents' masses and our principles.

@denounce
subtitle: The Left's answer. The Independent workers will not be grateful.
on-arrival: {!
Q.leipzig_line = 3;
Q.uspd_relation -= 10;
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
RG.ecci('zinoviev', 5);
!}
